  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arnur Credit Expanding Access to Finance for Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprise Borrowers Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction entails the Asian Development Bank (ADB) providing financing to Arnur Credit for on-lending to micro, small, and medium-sized enterprise (MSME) borrowers. The transaction will have a focus on on-lending to MSMEs owned and/or led by women (WMSMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
